{% comment %}
  Brand font @font-face declarations — self-hosted woff2 (Fontsource latin subsets).
  Rendered once per layout head, unconditionally: browsers only download faces
  used by rendered text, so unused declarations cost ~2 KB of CSS and zero requests.
  Family names are namespaced ('Inter Custom' etc.) so they can never collide with
  Shopify-CDN font_face output for the same family from a font_picker.
  Upright only in v1 — em/i under an active override synthesizes oblique; italic
  files are a later drop-in to this file only.

  License: all families below are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
  (https://openfontlicense.org).
    IBM Plex Sans, IBM Plex Mono — © IBM Corp., IBM Plex Project Authors
    Inter — © The Inter Project Authors (Rasmus Andersson)
    Geist, Geist Mono — © Vercel Inc., Geist Project Authors
    Overpass, Overpass Mono — © Red Hat Inc., Overpass Project Authors (Delve Fonts)
    DM Sans, DM Mono — © Colophon Foundry, Google, DM Fonts Project Authors
    Manrope — © Mikhail Sharanda, Manrope Project Authors
    Open Sans — © The Open Sans Project Authors (Google)
{% endcomment %}
<style>
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans Custom';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 100 700;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url('{{ 'font-ibm-plex-sans-latin-wght.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2');
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono Custom';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-display: swap;
